Description:It is your second main phase. You control Repercussion (whenever a creature is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to that creature's controller) and have Pyroclasm in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls two untapped Grizzly Bears. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-damage-trigger-per-creature | Repercussion triggers separately for each creature dealt damage (CR 603.2c): Pyroclasm deals 2 to each Bears, and each trigger deals 2 to their controller, 4 in total
